{"v":4,"catch":"化身年輕國王Evan、尋找建立新的國度、拯救人民逃離惡魔的魔掌。 The Prince's Edition包含了完整遊戲內容與所有DLC。","desc":"The Prince's Edition包含了完整遊戲內容與season pass，讓您擁有所有DLC的豐富內容。\n\n化身年輕國王Evan，為自己立了個宏偉的使命，尋找建立新的國度，與一同冒險犯難的伙伴們，將國家團結起來、拯救人民逃離惡魔的魔掌。\n踏入這令人難忘的冒險旅程，像動畫又像遊戲令人難以分辨的界限。 Ni no Kuni II是由 LEVEL-5開發，傳說級的美術家Yoshiyuki Momose(百瀨 義行)擔任角色設計，遊戲配樂即是由享譽國際的Joe Hisaishi(久石 讓)擔當。","publisher":"BANDAI NAMCO Entertainment Asia","release":"2021-09-17","genres":["角色扮演","冒險"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文","俄文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 11.5GB / Switch 11.5GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5bfb11e1a13cf9a2085aa9650d7078eb23b15d0fd5029e3a48016242cd0441d8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fa6385965ea432720d3a3f039761528399ce2f1152a6b0b3f7953bcffa03ea8b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/275db7bd67aa0d88c7eb0356b30b98ab59723970a25ba51e00752253ed4c7153.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9b6655e455689c09210c3afa03f2e7b2885f7022fccb74e8c5fb63ea61467475.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/31dfb23de934a0732fec6c0f1a7b5f475bb592155f212c78d28d3efba6a8171b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c3262b61c0d60ec9dfd10a646d9eb60a6d922816651c9d9c8a7a262d766fb7f6.jpg"],"titleId":"0100be7013e06000","dlc":[]}